ede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Minidoka County came in under 90% of normal in July to August in 42 of 75 years since 1951, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle ran 21% of normal in June to July and 134% in July to August. So far in 2026 it sits at 23% in May to June. Grid 27365 had its driest year in 2013 at 47% of normal.</p>"}
